{"headword":"רָדָה","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>vb.</strong> have dominion, rule, dominate <strong>(</strong>NH <span dir=\"rtl\">רָדָה</span>, 𝔗<sup>Jon</sup> <span dir=\"rtl\">רְדָא</span>, <em>chastise;</em> Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">رَدَى</span> <em>tread, trample;</em> Syriac <span dir=\"rtl\">ܪܕܳܐ</span> <em>chastise</em>, also (and so Assyrian <em>radû</em>) <em>go, flow</em><strong>)</strong>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pf. 3 pl. consec. <span dir=\"rtl\">וְרָדוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 14:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.14.2\">Is 14:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 26:17\" href=\"/Leviticus.26.17\">Lv 26:17</a>; 2 mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">רְדִיתֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 34:4\" href=\"/Ezekiel.34.4\">Ez 34:4</a>; Impf. 3 ms. sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִרְדֶּנּוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:53\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.53\">Lv 25:53</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיִּרְדֶּ֑נָּה</span> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 1:13\" href=\"/Lamentations.1.13\">La 1:13</a>, juss. <span dir=\"rtl\">וְיֵרְדְּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 24:19\" href=\"/Numbers.24.19\">Nu 24:19</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 72:8\" href=\"/Psalms.72.8\">ψ 72:8</a>; 2 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּרְדֶּה</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:43\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.43\">Lv 25:43</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:46\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.46\">46</a>, etc.; Imv. ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">רְדֵה</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 110:2\" href=\"/Psalms.110.2\">ψ 110:2</a>; mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">רְדוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 1:28\" href=\"/Genesis.1.28\">Gn 1:28</a>; (<a data-ref=\"Joel 4:13\" href=\"/Joel.4.13\">Jo 4:13</a> v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, יָרַד\" href=\"/BDB,_יָרַד\", dir=\"rtl\">ירד</a>); Inf. cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">רְדוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 29:15\" href=\"/Ezekiel.29.15\">Ez 29:15</a>; Pt. <span dir=\"rtl\">רֹדֶה</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 5:4\" href=\"/I_Kings.5.4\">1 K 5:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 14:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.14.6\">Is 14:6</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">רִדֵם</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 68:28\" href=\"/Psalms.68.28\">ψ 68:28</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">הָרֹרִים</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 5:30\" href=\"/I_Kings.5.30\">1 K 5:30</a> + 2 times;—<em>have dominion, rule</em>, over, usually c. ב pers. vel pop. <a data-ref=\"I Kings 5:4\" href=\"/I_Kings.5.4\">1 K 5:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 5:30\" href=\"/I_Kings.5.30\">30</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 9:23\" href=\"/I_Kings.9.23\">9:23</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 8:10\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.8.10\">2 Ch 8:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 14:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.14.2\">Is 14:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:43\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.43\">Lv 25:43</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:46\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.46\">46</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:53\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.53\">53</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 26:17\" href=\"/Leviticus.26.17\">26:17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 29:15\" href=\"/Ezekiel.29.15\">Ez 29:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 9:28\" href=\"/Nehemiah.9.28\">Ne 9:28</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 49:15\" href=\"/Psalms.49.15\">ψ 49:15</a>; ב of fish, etc., <a data-ref=\"Genesis 1:26\" href=\"/Genesis.1.26\">Gn 1:26</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 1:28\" href=\"/Genesis.1.28\">28</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּקֶרֶב</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 110:2\" href=\"/Psalms.110.2\">ψ 110:2</a>; c. acc. pers. <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 34:4\" href=\"/Ezekiel.34.4\">Ez 34:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 14:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.14.6\">Is 14:6</a> (perhaps + acc. cogn., v. [<a data-ref=\"BDB, מִרְדָּה²\" href=\"/BDB,_מִרְדָּה²\", dir=\"rtl\">מִרְדָּה</a>] infr.); acc. om. <a data-ref=\"Numbers 24:19\" href=\"/Numbers.24.19\">Nu 24:19</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(מִיַּעֲקֹב)</span>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 5:31\" href=\"/Jeremiah.5.31\">Je 5:31</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">עַל־יְדֵיהֶם</span>, v. <span dir=\"rtl\">יָד</span> <strong>5 h</strong> (2); vid. also ingenious conj. sub <a data-ref=\"BDB, רָדָה²\" href=\"/BDB,_רָדָה²\", dir=\"rtl\">II. רדה</a>; but < Gr <span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹרוּ</span> <em>teach</em>), <a data-ref=\"Psalms 72:8\" href=\"/Psalms.72.8\">ψ 72:8</a>; for <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיִּרְדֶּנָּה</span> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 1:13\" href=\"/Lamentations.1.13\">La 1:13</a> <em>and it</em> (the fire) <em>prevailed against them</em> (my bones), read perhaps <span dir=\"rtl\">יָרָ֑דָה</span> into my bones <em>it descended</em> (Bu).—<span dir=\"rtl\">רֹדֵם</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 68:28\" href=\"/Psalms.68.28\">ψ 68:28</a> is dub.; Grill Hup-Now Che Du <span dir=\"rtl\">קִדֵּם</span>. <span dir=\"rtl\">יְרַד</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 5:13\" href=\"/Judges.5.13\">Ju 5:13</a><sup>(×2)</sup> v. <a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, יָרַד\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_יָרַד\">יָרַד</a>."}],"form":"Qal"},{"senses":[{"definition":"Impf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">וּמְלָכִים יַרְדְּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 41:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.41.2\">Is 41:2</a> <em>and kings he causeth</em> (him) <em>to dominate;</em> but apoc. form strange, read <span dir=\"rtl\">יָרֹד</span> (√ <span dir=\"rtl\">רדד</span> q.v.) Ew Di Du; <span dir=\"rtl\">יַחֲרִד</span> 𝔊 Klo Che."}],"form":"Hiph."}]},"rid":"BDB09168","strong_numbers":["7287"],"next_hw":"מִרְדָּה²","prev_hw":"רַדַּי","all_cited":true,"ordinal":"I.","brackets":"first_word","root":true,"quotes":[],"GK":["8097","8098"],"TWOT":["2121","2122"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","attribution":"F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs","index_title":"BDB","version_title":"A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs. Oxford, 1906","version_lang":"en","should_autocomplete":true}}